          <div class="selfhelp-step"><div class="selfhelp-num">2</div><div><strong>Check Your Boiler Pressure</strong><p>If your boiler shows a fault code or you have no hot water, check the pressure gauge. It should read between 1 and 1.5 bar. Below 0.5 bar you can repressurise using the filling loop.</p></div></div>
          <div class="selfhelp-step"><div class="selfhelp-num">3</div><div><strong>Check Your Neighbours</strong><p>If you have no water or heating, check if your neighbours are affected. If they are, it is a <a href="https://www.unitedutilities.com/emergencies/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;">United Utilities</a> network fault. Call 0345 672 3723.</p></div></div>
